# Migrated (D-SERVICE-EFFECTS1=A): a workflow wait names the file and wait
# effects its Core source reaches instead of the retired fixed `Time`/`IO`
# rows. The sleep records its wait in the state store (FS.Write) and waits
# (Time.Wait); an activity and its join append to the store (FS.Write) and
# stamp the record with the wall clock (Time). The effects arrive through the
# callee edge, so they are inferred effects, not direct ones, and each
# signature names the FS root it now reaches.
